		<item>
		<title>
		By: Patrick Dugan (@duganist)		</title>
		<link>https://uncommoncore.co/physical-vs-financial-crypto/#comment-9</link>

		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Patrick Dugan (@duganist)]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 28 Jan 2019 16:56:02 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://uncommoncore.co/?p=714#comment-9</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[Great post. The value of financial crypto can also be a flight-to-safety play, a time value play, or a flight to quality (in terms of parking capital outside of the banking system in a way that will retain value). Part of the underlying value is also that the EFP trade is a thing, one can be long spot/short futures to have a synthetic cash position. I hate to be rather monothematic about synth. cash but its importance is understated. 

Also there&#039;s two sides to the financialization - going long or short with the derivative and accomplishing a short by borrowing the underlying. Having long-term borrow supply is an important center of gravity and creates longer-term demand for EFP transactions. If the borrow can be done at a low enough cost of carry, the resulting &quot;anti-synth. cash&quot; position could itself have a positive carry.]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Great post. The value of financial crypto can also be a flight-to-safety play, a time value play, or a flight to quality (in terms of parking capital outside of the banking system in a way that will retain value). Part of the underlying value is also that the EFP trade is a thing, one can be long spot/short futures to have a synthetic cash position. I hate to be rather monothematic about synth. cash but its importance is understated. </p>
<p>Also there&#8217;s two sides to the financialization &#8211; going long or short with the derivative and accomplishing a short by borrowing the underlying. Having long-term borrow supply is an important center of gravity and creates longer-term demand for EFP transactions. If the borrow can be done at a low enough cost of carry, the resulting &#8220;anti-synth. cash&#8221; position could itself have a positive carry.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
		
